ed.\n- The age threshold is configurable, and changing it changes which runs the\n  report lists.\n- The report's data is populated from Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata via the\n  console's existing pipelines integration.\n- The Data Science Pipelines component is unchanged by this epic: run\n  execution, metadata retention, and artifact storage behave exactly as before\n  (passive-component validation).\n- Administrators can export the stale pipeline-run report as CSV, and the\n  exported file contains the report's rows and columns.\n- The report is display-only: no reclamation or deletion action is offered.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-2 (P1)** — delivers the stale pipeline-run report (completed runs older\n  than a configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from Kubeflow\n  Pipelines run metadata.\n- **HLR-3 (P2, bundled)** — CSV export of the report is implemented here: the\n  export action lives on this report's own UI surface and shares its data, so\n  it is not separately schedulable from the report itself.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":46811,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99f844a42ff9bb63","agent_id":"af98b122f29171fcb","session_id":"66891df0-ced6-412e-9fab-8ee1943bcf3f","uuid":"c96cf23c-3ba7-404b-abbe-073cf4c12eae","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:22:29.526Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
